{"song_id": 2289056, "title": "Poo-Putt Platter", "language": "en", "lyricists": "[70]", "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_0", "type": "skit", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "I tripped a lot out here in the woods lately, ugh!", "rhyme": "yg"}, {"n": "1", "text": "This is a platter of... this makes an, an exceptionally good late night's snack and also a dandy fly swatter", "rhyme": "e"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Ah, my eyes are going, I can't hit it", "rhyme": "it"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Nothing comes between me and my masters", "rhyme": "9R"}, {"n": "4", "text": "(What is it father?)", "rhyme": null}, {"n": "5", "text": "These footprints were by th\u2014 flying monkey men", "rhyme": "En"}, {"n": "6", "text": "(But they've never strayed from the Valley since we made the pig feet)", "rhyme": null}, {"n": "7", "text": "Yes, that is what disturbs me", "rhyme": "@"}, {"n": "8", "text": "He'd probably get indigestion", "rhyme": "$"}, {"n": "9", "text": "You will go", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "10", "text": "(I don't think so", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "11", "text": "Take them)", "rhyme": "Em"}, {"n": "12", "text": "This jungle is dangerous \u2014rapper", "rhyme": "e"}, {"n": "13", "text": "You will need assistance", "rhyme": "#s"}, {"n": "14", "text": "(I know what I'm doing)", "rhyme": null}, {"n": "15", "text": "You risked your life for us, thanks", "rhyme": "#k"}, {"n": "16", "text": "I lost an arm", "rhyme": "uRm"}, {"n": "17", "text": "(Good)", "rhyme": null}, {"n": "18", "text": "Stop it, father!", "rhyme": "ER"}, {"n": "19", "text": "(Stand back!", "rhyme": "ak"}, {"n": "20", "text": "Return to the house)", "rhyme": "awz"}, {"n": "21", "text": "No", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "22", "text": "What the?", "rhyme": "at"}, {"n": "23", "text": "Now \u2014rapper, perhaps you will listen", "rhyme": "En"}]}]}